}</pre>
<p>After parent init + parent constructor, this slice prints 0 / child first block / child second block (then child constructor still remains).</p>
<h3>52:05 — Child constructor (27) then back to `Child.main` (28)</h3>
<p>Instance CF step 5: execution of child constructor — step 27 — &quot;Child constructor&quot;.</p>
<p>Cinema started at step 3 (Child c = new Child();). After 27, object is created and initialized. Control returns to execute the remaining part of main: step 28 — &quot;Child main&quot;.</p>
